         <description>
            <p>
                The repository provides a set of improved Pixinsight scripts from various authors as well as some newly written scripts.
            </p>
            <p>
               Updates:
               <br/>
               SubframeQualityReview 0.55.1: Prevent stale recommendations from being applied, preserve completed reviews during reanalysis and cached results after moving rejected originals. Improve faint-object ROI handling and ensure exported instances use the installed WBPP script.
